          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Inicia sesión en %@ y pulsa Actualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ database is busy. Wait a moment and click Refresh." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the official app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La base de datos de %@ está ocupada. Espera un momento y pulsa Actualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ session belongs to another account. The previous account's figures were cleared." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the official app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sesión de %@ es de otra cuenta. Se borraron las cifras de la anterior."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ session is in a format %@ doesn't recognize." : {
      "comment" : "The official app, then the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sesión de %1$@ tiene un formato que %2$@ no reconoce."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The %@ session isn't from a subscription (e.g., it uses an API key). Sign in to %@ with your subscription and click Refresh." : {
      "comment" : "Both %@ are the official app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La sesión de %1$@ no es de una suscripción (p. ej., usa una clave de API). Inicia sesión con tu suscripción en %2$@ y pulsa Actualizar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cards follow the order of this list. A provider that's turned off has no card, and %@ doesn't read its session or check its usage limits." : {
      "comment" : "%@ is the app name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El orden de la lista es el de las tarjetas. Un proveedor desactivado no tiene tarjeta, y %@ no lee su sesión ni consulta sus límites de uso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This session has no subscription usage limits" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta sesión no tiene límites de uso de suscripción"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Timed out" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
